        "cooked": "<p>Well-</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We have been playing this and just completed our 20th game. I couldn't help it and have udated the spreadsheet with the most current SOTM and Cauldron characters.&nbsp; Part of me really wants to formulate it so unlocked charachters would highlight after requirements were checked off- but I don't think I will ever be up for that project.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Anyway- I figured I would post this so anyone could use it if they liked.&nbsp; So many more battles to go...&nbsp; enjoy.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Update- I have not updated the yellow unlock sections yet by each set- but the unlock points for each character and promo are listed by each one.</p>",
